2:T45c,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"When should we upgrade to Shopify Plus?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The trigger is typically: transaction volume where Plus fees become cost-effective (around $1M+ GMV), operational complexity requiring custom checkout logic, B2B requirements, multi-market needs, or automation requirements that go beyond standard Shopify's capabilities."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What does Shopify Plus cost?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Shopify Plus starts at $2,300/month for most merchants. The development and implementation cost depends on complexity. We'll scope your project accurately in a discovery call."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can you migrate us from standard Shopify to Shopify Plus without disruption?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes — upgrading to Plus doesn't require a migration in the traditional sense. It's a plan change. The development work involves implementing Plus-specific features (custom checkout, automation, B2B) on top of your existing store."}}]}0:{"rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Service\",\"name\":\"Shopify Plus Enterprise Solutions\",\"description\":\"Shopify Plus development and strategy for enterprise ecommerce. Custom checkout extensions, B2B, multi-store management, automation and high-volume architecture — Shopify Plus done properly.\",\"provider\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Agentix\",\"url\":\"https://agentixmarketing.com\"},\"areaServed\":\"US\",\"url\":\"https://agentixmarketing.com/services/shopify-plus-enterprise\"}"}}],["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$2"}}],[["$","section",null,{"className":"svc-hero theme-dark","id":"top","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"hero-glow"}],["$","div",null,{"c